# Snyk (https://snyk.io) policy file, patches or ignores known vulnerabilities.
version: v1.25.1
ignore:
  SNYK-JS-ADMZIP-21707815:
    - '*':
        reason: >-
          adm-zip has no fixed version: 0.6.1 is the latest published release and every version
          is affected (CVE-2026-116137, published 2026-10-25). It reaches this project only through
          Sanity's CLI tooling (@module-federation/dts-plugin below @sanity/workbench-cli and
          @sanity/cli-build, through next-sanity and sanity), which extracts the type archives of
          Sanity's own module-federation remotes while building; nothing in the deployed website
          runs it. Revisit once adm-zip publishes a patched release.
        expires: 2026-11-25T00:00:00.000Z
  SNYK-JS-BRACES-19963945:
    - '*':
        reason: >-
          braces has no fixed version: 3.0.3 is the latest published release and every version is
          affected (CVE-2026-93687). It reaches this project only through Sanity's CLI tooling
          (micromatch, chokidar and fast-glob below @sanity/cli and @sanity/codegen), which expands
          glob patterns from this repository's own configuration and never outside input. Revisit
          once braces publishes a patched release.
        expires: 2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z
  SNYK-JS-MINIMATCH-22111072:
    - '*':
        reason: >-
          minimatch is only fixed in 11.0.1, and the flaw needs a crafted glob pattern parsed with
          optimizationLevel 2 or higher. The 10.x copies are gone (react-email and @sentry/node
          moved to glob 14, @oclif/core is overridden to 11), but 3.1.5 still sits below @lhci/cli
          (chrome-launcher 0.13, rimraf 3, glob 7), a dev dependency that removes its own
          temporary Chrome profile. glob 7 builds on the minimatch 3 API, which 11 no longer has,
          so it cannot be pinned forward, and GitHub's advisory does not list 3.x at all. None of
          it runs in the deployed website or sees outside input. Revisit once Lighthouse CI drops
          rimraf 3.
        expires: 2026-12-01T00:00:00.000Z
  SNYK-JS-PICOMATCH-21248802:
    - '*':
        reason: >-
          picomatch has no fixed version: 4.0.7 is the latest published release and every version
          is affected (CVE-2026-112366). It reaches this project only through tooling: chokidar and
          anymatch below @sanity/codegen (Sanity's CLI, through next-sanity and sanity), and vitest
          as the optional peer of get-it below @sanity/client. Both compile glob patterns from this
          repository's own configuration, never outside input, and neither runs in the deployed
          app. Revisit once picomatch publishes a patched release.
        expires: 2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z
patch: {}
